   '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everyone on the team gets their own account inside the workspace. Their role decides what they see and what they can change."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Send an invitation"}]},{"type":"steps","content":[{"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Under "},{"type":"text","text":"Settings → Team","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" press "},{"type":"text","text":"Invite member","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Enter their email address and choose a role."}]}]},{"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Press "},{"type":"text","text":"Send invitation","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Your colleague receives an email with a join link that stays valid for seven days."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Available roles"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Role"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sees"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Can"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Admin"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All conversations, settings and billing"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything, including inviting and removing members"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agent"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversations assigned to them and their team"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Reply, assign conversations and use saved replies"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Viewer"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversations and reports"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read only, without replying or editing"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"info"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You can change anyone''s role at any time. The change applies immediately and does not disturb conversations in flight."}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Remove a member"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"On the team page, open the member''s menu and choose "},{"type":"text","text":"Remove from workspace","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Their conversations and replies stay in the history, and anything assigned to them returns to the “Unassigned” list."}]}]}'::jsonb,
   'Everyone on the team gets their own account inside the workspace. Their role decides what they see and what they can change.

Send an invitation

1. Under Settings → Team press Invite member.
2. Enter their email address and choose a role.
3. Press Send invitation. Your colleague receives an email with a join link that stays valid for seven days.

Available roles

Role | Sees | Can
Admin | All conversations, settings and billing | Everything, including inviting and removing members
Agent | Conversations assigned to them and their team | Reply, assign conversations and use saved replies
Viewer | Conversations and reports | Read only, without replying or editing

You can change anyone''s role at any time. The change applies immediately and does not disturb conversations in flight.

Remove a member

On the team page, open the member''s menu and choose Remove from workspace. Their conversations and replies stay in the history, and anything assigned to them returns to the “Unassigned” list.',
