   '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Flovoo works through the official WhatsApp Business Platform. Your number stays yours, and more than one person on the team can reply from it at the same time."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before you start"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"text","text":"Meta Business","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://business.facebook.com"}}]},{"type":"text","text":" account where you have admin rights."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A phone number that can receive an SMS or a call for verification."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The number is not currently used in the WhatsApp or WhatsApp Business app on a phone. If it is, delete the account from the app first."}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"warning"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Deleting a WhatsApp account from a phone removes the old chat history from that device. Export the conversations you care about first."}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Connect the number"}]},{"type":"steps","content":[{"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Under "},{"type":"text","text":"Settings → Channels","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" press "},{"type":"text","text":"Connect WhatsApp","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sign in to Meta and choose the business account you want to use."}]}]},{"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Enter the phone number in international format, such as "},{"type":"text","text":"+966 5X XXX XXXX","marks":[{"type":"ltr"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and pick a verification method."}]}]},{"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Enter the six-digit verification code."}]}]},{"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Type the display name customers will see. It has to match your business name."}]}]}]},{"type":"figure","attrs":{"src":"/help/whatsapp-connect.svg","alt":"The WhatsApp connection dialog showing the list of business accounts and the phone number field.","caption":"Choosing the business account and entering the number during setup.","width":1200,"height":720}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"After connecting"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"New messages reach the inbox within minutes. Send a test message from your own phone to the number to confirm everything works, then reply to it from Flovoo."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Frequently asked"}]},{"type":"faq","content":[{"type":"faqItem","attrs":{"question":"Can I connect more than one number?"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes. Each number appears as its own channel in the inbox, and you can decide which team looks after each one."}]}]},{"type":"faqItem","attrs":{"question":"Do I lose old conversations?"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Chats that happened in the phone app do not move to Flovoo. Messages start appearing from the moment you connect."}]}]},{"type":"faqItem","attrs":{"question":"What if the verification code never arrives?"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Wait two minutes, then request the code by call instead of SMS. If it still fails, check that the number is not registered in another app."}]}]}]}]}'::jsonb,
   'Flovoo works through the official WhatsApp Business Platform. Your number stays yours, and more than one person on the team can reply from it at the same time.

Before you start

- A Meta Business account where you have admin rights.
- A phone number that can receive an SMS or a call for verification.
- The number is not currently used in the WhatsApp or WhatsApp Business app on a phone. If it is, delete the account from the app first.

Deleting a WhatsApp account from a phone removes the old chat history from that device. Export the conversations you care about first.

Connect the number

1. Under Settings → Channels press Connect WhatsApp.
2. Sign in to Meta and choose the business account you want to use.
3. Enter the phone number in international format, such as +966 5X XXX XXXX, and pick a verification method.
4. Enter the six-digit verification code.
5. Type the display name customers will see. It has to match your business name.

Choosing the business account and entering the number during setup.

After connecting

New messages reach the inbox within minutes. Send a test message from your own phone to the number to confirm everything works, then reply to it from Flovoo.

Frequently asked

Can I connect more than one number?
Yes. Each number appears as its own channel in the inbox, and you can decide which team looks after each one.

Do I lose old conversations?
Chats that happened in the phone app do not move to Flovoo. Messages start appearing from the moment you connect.

What if the verification code never arrives?
Wait two minutes, then request the code by call instead of SMS. If it still fails, check that the number is not registered in another app.',
