   '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A campaign is a WhatsApp message sent to a group of contacts at once. It needs an approved marketing template and customers who agreed to hear from you."}]},{"type":"callout","attrs":{"variant":"warning"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Send campaigns only to people who opted in. Repeated reports lower your number''s quality rating and can pause it temporarily."}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Create the campaign"}]},{"type":"steps","content":[{"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Under "},{"type":"text","text":"Campaigns","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" press "},{"type":"text","text":"New campaign","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and choose the sending number."}]}]},{"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Define the audience: all contacts, a specific tag, or a CSV file you import now."}]}]},{"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose the approved template and fill in its variables. Each variable can map to a contact field."}]}]},{"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Check the phone preview, then choose "},{"type":"text","text":"Send now","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" or schedule a time."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read the results"}]},{"type":"table","content":[{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Metric"}]}]},{"type":"tableHeader","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Meaning"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sent"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The message left Flovoo for WhatsApp"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Delivered"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"It reached the customer''s phone"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The customer opened it (if they have read receipts on)"}]}]}]},{"type":"tableRow","content":[{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Replied"}]}]},{"type":"tableCell","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The customer wrote back, and the conversation appears in the inbox"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Replies to a campaign land in the inbox as ordinary conversations, and routing rules can send them straight to the sales team."}]}]}'::jsonb,
   'A campaign is a WhatsApp message sent to a group of contacts at once. It needs an approved marketing template and customers who agreed to hear from you.

Send campaigns only to people who opted in. Repeated reports lower your number''s quality rating and can pause it temporarily.

Create the campaign

1. Under Campaigns press New campaign and choose the sending number.
2. Define the audience: all contacts, a specific tag, or a CSV file you import now.
3. Choose the approved template and fill in its variables. Each variable can map to a contact field.
4. Check the phone preview, then choose Send now or schedule a time.

Read the results

Metric | Meaning
Sent | The message left Flovoo for WhatsApp
Delivered | It reached the customer''s phone
Read | The customer opened it (if they have read receipts on)
Replied | The customer wrote back, and the conversation appears in the inbox

Replies to a campaign land in the inbox as ordinary conversations, and routing rules can send them straight to the sales team.',
