   '{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Change the payment method"}]},{"type":"steps","content":[{"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Under "},{"type":"text","text":"Settings → Billing","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" press "},{"type":"text","text":"Payment method","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Enter the new card details. Visa, Mastercard and mada are accepted."}]}]},{"type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The new card is used from the next invoice, and the old one is removed automatically."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Add a tax number"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"In the "},{"type":"text","text":"Invoice details","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" section enter the company name, address and tax number, such as "},{"type":"text","text":"3XXXXXXXXXXXXX3","marks":[{"type":"ltr"}]},{"type":"text","text":". It appears on every invoice issued after you save. Earlier invoices cannot be edited."}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Download invoices"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All invoices are listed in the "},{"type":"text","text":"Invoice history","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" table with their status and amount. Press the download icon to save a PDF, or turn on "},{"type":"text","text":"Email invoices","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":" so they reach your accounting inbox automatically each month."}]}]}'::jsonb,
   'Change the payment method

1. Under Settings → Billing press Payment method.
2. Enter the new card details. Visa, Mastercard and mada are accepted.
3. The new card is used from the next invoice, and the old one is removed automatically.

Add a tax number

In the Invoice details section enter the company name, address and tax number, such as 3XXXXXXXXXXXXX3. It appears on every invoice issued after you save. Earlier invoices cannot be edited.

Download invoices

All invoices are listed in the Invoice history table with their status and amount. Press the download icon to save a PDF, or turn on Email invoices so they reach your accounting inbox automatically each month.',
   null, null, null, '[{"id":"change-the-payment-method","level":2,"text":"Change the payment method"},{"id":"add-a-tax-number","level":2,"text":"Add a tax number"},{"id":"download-invoices","level":2,"text":"Download invoices"}]'::jsonb, 1,
